flowchart TB
  UI[Attendance screens] --> Repo[attendance_repository]
  Repo --> Store[AttendanceStore in-memory]
  Repo --> FS[Firestore]
  Repo --> RTD[Realtime Database]

  UI --> Queues[Pending *Queue files]
  Queues --> Hive[AttendanceLocalQueues storage]

  Conn[Connectivity / app resume] --> Orch[attendance_offline_sync]
  Orch --> SyncWorkers[Pending *Sync files]
  SyncWorkers --> Queues
  SyncWorkers --> Repo

  Watchers[Remote / RTD watches] --> Store
  Watchers --> FS
  Watchers --> RTD
